he darkening road, pulls his cloak tighter. On the final frame he is still standing at his post, watching the road; the picture holds to the last frame.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nRain, distant birdsong, the creak of old wood.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA single low flute line, sparse, unresolved.
